<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB 13-wk bills yield 12.4 pct, demand weak.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB 13-wk bills yield 12.4 pct, demand weak.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yield in an auction offering three billion crowns in 13-week Czech National Bank liquidity bills was 12.4 percent, and the Dutch auction was undersubscribed, the CNB said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 1.336 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The yield was unchanged from last week's auction of similar bills.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom,  42-2-2423-0003</p>
